ESF adapts the Propose-Probe-Compose algorithm and role instructions into its
own Go/Temporal controller. The Python runner, benchmark installers, unrestricted
executors, mutable guardrails, scripts, plugins, hooks and subagents are not
included. ESF applies a restricted instructional surface and owns verification,
credentials, network access, reservations, evidence and reviewed promotion.

The accompanying Apache-2.0 LICENSE applies to the upstream material. New ESF
integration code is covered by the repository license. The upstream project is
not an officially supported Google product.
